"slug":"/html-rendering-story/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🖥️ HTML이 브라우저에 그려지는 여정","summary":"HTML의 기나긴 여정","date":"2025.07.10.","categories":["Web","Html"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/473b7/HtmlStory.png","srcSet":"/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/be4d9/HtmlStory.png 192w,\n/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/5fc50/HtmlStory.png 384w,\n/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/473b7/HtmlStory.png 768w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/b3234/HtmlStory.webp 192w,\n/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/65a7c/HtmlStory.webp 384w,\n/static/a61771e37ca65a0952605023f367d460/30053/HtmlStory.webp 768w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"a47ad06b-7758-5e99-a44f-1dacd3c2157a","fields":{"slug":"/webassembly_webgpu_trend_story/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"🚀 브라우저 안의 혁명: WebAssembly + WebGPU로 여는 고성능 웹의 미래","summary":"🌐 Prologue: 브라우저는 더 이상 단순한 문서 뷰어가 아니다","date":"2025.08.06.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/473b7/WebGPU.png","srcSet":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/be4d9/WebGPU.png 192w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/5fc50/WebGPU.png 384w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/473b7/WebGPU.png 768w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/b3234/WebGPU.webp 192w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/65a7c/WebGPU.webp 384w,\n/static/9f0a5c6c36809b475b3036130624dd70/30053/WebGPU.webp 768w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}}]